<title>USA: JTS CFO Virginia Walker resigns.</title>
<headline>JTS CFO Virginia Walker resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>JTS Corp said its chief financial officer, W. Virginia Walker has resigned.</p>
<p>The company has initiated a search for a replacement and said that in the interim, Joseph Prezioso, vice president and corporate controller, will serve as acting chief financial officer.</p>
<p>JTS makes enhanced-capacity hard disk drives.</p>
